/*
 * Configuration PROM:	 !! all 8-Bit IO's !!
 *					    |<-	  MAC-Address	 ->|
 *	/-+--+--+--+--+-//-+--+--+--+--+-//-+--+--+--+--+-//-+--+--+--+--+-/
 * val:	  |PROD_ID0..3|	   | free      |    |00|00|5A|40|    |nn|mm|00|00|
